                    excluding metal branches shorter than 0.24µm) : 0.06µm</description>
   <categories>
   </categories>
  </category>
  <category>
   <name>CO.6b</name>
   <description>CO.6b : (ii) If Metal1 overlaps contact by &lt; 0.04um on one side,
